  "solution": {
    "text": "m = ZIt <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/>It = Total charge passed through copper voltameter <br/>= Area under the curve <br/><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>  <br/>So <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
